+\end{yr7box}
+
+\begin{yr8box}
+\subsection*{5.2 Optimising Range (Year 8 Extension)}
+
+\begin{infobox}{Range equation --- angled launch}
+\[R = \frac{v^2 \sin(2\theta)}{g}\]
+Maximum range occurs at $\theta = 45°$, giving $R_{\max} = v^2/g$.
+\end{infobox}
+
+\question{7}{2}{A ball is launched at 20\,m/s. Calculate the maximum range (at $\theta = 45°$).}
